[[2,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237491\">1032B47</a></p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF postition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237489\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Fit the flywheel lock.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.898.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014519.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the (left hand thread) bolt (1a) and remove the drive pulley\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014520.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the drive pulley (1a) back in its housing and secure it\ntightening the bolt (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt with left hand thread</p></td><td><p>TOOTHED DRIVE PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M16</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Crankshaft side) 20.9 ÷ 23.1</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014521.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>Remove the flywheel lock.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.898.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237489\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"],[64,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237491\">1032B47</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237823\">1060G80</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <strong>- 7055B91 Right front WHEEL ARCH\nLINER - R.R.</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n       